{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:76d85343b0966d5e","name":"Anti-Aircraft Flak Pod","source":{"id":"source:reference-76d85343b0966d5e","title":"Anti-Aircraft Flak Pod","revision":15840,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:18Z","sha256":"f490b176bacfffd1f841903a49d8411e0d141d4c648e9ede0728c40a4ee3e2f8","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=15840","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Anti-Aircraft%20Flak%20Pod&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-76d85343b0966d5e","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 5d10x5\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Flak Pod uses a rapid-loading system to launch dozens of Flak Missiles in a scatter pattern. These missiles use onboard targeting systems to home in on enemy ships. Firing an Anti-Aircraft Flak Pod is an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"},", even at ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Scale"},": the Flak Pod ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunner"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunner","referenceId":"reference:0cbc0bc5729f801f"}," must choose a 2x2-Square (",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Scale"},") area within the pod's range and make an attack roll against a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of 10.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If successful, compare the result to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of each ship in that area. If the attack roll hits a target, the Flak Missiles deal 5d10x5 damage to that ship; if the attack misses, the Flak Missiles deal half damage. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilots"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilots"}," with the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Evasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Evasion"}]}," Talent cause their ship to take half damage from a hit or no damage on a miss.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
